## What we are doing

1. **Saturday clinic at Eastgate**, starting 2026-11-07. Eastgate lost Dr. Hana Yoshida in August and has 2 open physician posts.
2. **Text reminders two days before visits.** The Lakeview pilot cut its no-show rate from 8.0% to 5.9%.
3. **Longer phone hours at Harlan Street**, with lines staying open until 19:00.
